# Local-first operator data (archives, databases, reference downloads,
# scans, caches and credentials-adjacent state). All runtime data belong to
# the operator and must not be staged as source or make source-build identity
# look dirty merely because the application saved a case or imported an image.
# Existing tracked validation metadata remains tracked by Git.
data/
# Scratch data dirs an ad-hoc verification script may create under tests/.
# A scan writes real artefacts (cache .npz, worldcover clips, scan records);
# committing them bloats the repo and puts derived data under version control.
backend/tests/_tmp_*/
**/_tmp_contract_data/
# Frontend
# (package-lock.json is intentionally tracked once Gate 0B creates it)

tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
